eXtensible
Messaging &
Presence
Protocol
.CL 0.50
.ps 12
.vs 12
.fi
.ft 5
Constantly evolving messaging. Made for real-time communications: text, audio, video, photos… An official IETF standard. Anyone can read the details and build their own XMPP-speaking program.
.CE
.HR
.CS
.CL 0.50
Used for more than 25 years in all imaginable situations: chatting between friends and family, military radio communications, powering the world's largest companies.
Built in the open, by the XSF,
and a large, friendly community of developers and users.
End-to-end encrypted by default. Easy to take
ownership of your data by self-hosting.
.CL 0.5
.ps 20
.vs 18
.ft 1 
.nf
tried and tested
independent
privacy-focused
