.CE
.fi
.ft 4
.ps 14
.HR
.ce
TIPS ON JOINING XMPP ON THE OTHER SIDE
.bp
.ft 1
.sp 1c
.ps 20
.vs 20
.ce
How do I get started?
.sp 0.5c
.ps 10
.vs 10
.ft 5
The XMPP public network is federated — it is composed of numerous servers, which communicate with one another. Getting an account means doing 2 things: installing a chat client for your device and registering an account at an XMPP provider.
.HR
.ps 14
.vs 14
.ce
.ad l
.ft 1
Pick a chat client…
.ps 10
.vs 10

.ft 5
Here are some recommandations. You can view the full list of clients on the XMPP website.
