.ps 14
.vs 14
.ce
.ft 1
Choose your provider…

.ps 10
.vs 10
.ad
.ft 5
The easiest way of getting an account is by getting an invitation. Ask someone with an XMPP account for one, and you're set. If you don't know anyone with an XMPP account, you can still register quite easily on a public provider. Most programs offer you the option of choosing from a list of providers when attempting registration. 

If you want more information about providers, and a tool to compare them, you can also check
.US https://providers.xmpp.net
